  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Sekolah Rakyat education initiative is receiving increased attention from national and regional officials across Indonesia. President Prabowo Subianto recently observed students from the program perform at the Bank Indonesia Annual Meeting, while other officials have been assessing school infrastructure and digital connectivity in areas like Bekasi. In the Natuna Regency, local leadership is conducting outreach to ensure families in need are informed about the program. The initiative, which is managed by the Ministry of Social Affairs, aims to develop diverse talents, including in digital and AI fields, as well as sports like Pencak Silat. Additionally, collaborative efforts between the Ministry of Social Affairs and the BKKBN are underway to establish peer counseling services across 143 schools, while local drug prevention agencies have begun safety initiatives, such as conducting urine tests to prevent substance abuse among the student population.",
